<SiteLayout title="Sell Lemons Sewer Maze Map: Lever Rooms and Key Routes" description="Follow a Sell Lemons sewer maze map with lever rooms, Sewer Key, UFO route, Cosmic Cash Vine notes, mobile steps, video references, and evidence labels.">
  <main>
    <section class="page-hero guide-detail-hero">
      <div class="wrap page-hero__grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Map First</p>
          <h1>Sell Lemons Sewer Maze Map</h1>
          <p>Use this sewer maze map as a route-first reference before entering the underground puzzle. Pick one objective first, then follow the matching checkpoints instead of mixing key routes.</p>
        </div>
        <img src="/sell_lemons_hero_main.png" alt="Sell Lemons sewer maze map route reference" width="894" height="500" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <article class="guide-detail">
      <section class="route-map" aria-label="Sewer maze route map">
        <div>Entry</div>
        <div>Main Split</div>
        <div>Blue / Red / Green / Purple Lever Rooms</div>
        <div>Vault Door</div>
        <div>UFO Route</div>
      </section>

      <p class="evidence-note">Evidence boundary: route structures are reported from community pages and can change after game updates. Confirm final turns in-game before treating any step as verified.</p>

      <p class="evidence-note">disputed: Blue and Teal may refer to the same first lever across sources, but the naming mismatch remains a conflict until checked in-game.</p>

      <section aria-labelledby="objective-selector-title">
        <h2 id="objective-selector-title">Objective Selector</h2>
        <div class="route-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Maze objective routes">
          {routePlans.map((route, index) => (
            <button
              class={`tier-pill ${index === 0 ? "is-active" : ""}`}
              type="button"
              role="tab"
              aria-selected={index === 0 ? "true" : "false"}
              aria-controls={`${route.id}-panel`}
              data-route-tab={route.id}
            >
              <span class="tier-pill__dot"></span>
              {route.label}
            </button>
          ))}
        </div>

        {routePlans.map((route, index) => (
          <section
            class={`guide-panel ${index === 0 ? "is-active" : ""}`}
            id={`${route.id}-panel`}
            data-route-panel={route.id}
            aria-labelledby={`${route.id}-title`}
          >
            <span class="tag">{route.status}</span>
            <h3 id={`${route.id}-title`}>{route.title}</h3>
            <p>{route.summary}</p>
            <div class="route-table">
              {route.checkpoints.map((checkpoint) => (
                <div>
                  <strong>{checkpoint.label}</strong>
                  <span>{checkpoint.value}</span>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
            <h3>Mobile Steps</h3>
            <ol class="mobile-step-list">
              {route.mobileSteps.map((step) => <li>{step}</li>)}
            </ol>
          </section>
        ))}
      </section>

      <h2>Reset Recovery</h2>
      <div class="info-grid">
        {recoveryNotes.map((item) => (
          <section class="guide-step-card">
            <span class="tag">reported</span>
            <h3>{item.title}</h3>
            <p>{item.note}</p>
          </section>
        ))}
      </div>

      <VideoGuideBlock
        id="sewer-maze-video-guides"
        title="Video Maze References"
        note="youtube_embed: sewer maze videos help with visual turns, but this page does not treat videos as verified map or reward evidence."
        videos={youtubeEmbeds}
      />

      <h2>Route Cluster</h2>
      <div class="mini-table">
        <a href="/maze-map/">Open broad maze map</a>
        <a href="/lever-sequence/">Open lever sequence checklist</a>
        <a href="/sewer-key/">Prepare sewer key entry</a>
        <a href="/ufo-key/">Follow UFO key route</a>
        <a href="/badge-tracker/">Track badge status</a>
        <a href="/deals/">Return to deals and secrets hub</a>
      </div>

      <h2>FAQ</h2>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details class="faq-card">
          <summary>Why does the route split into three objectives?</summary>
          <div class="faq-card__body">
            <p>Sewer Key, UFO Key, and Cosmic Cash Vine routes share the same underground area, but they do not use the same checklist state. Mixing them is the fastest way to lose the route.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-card">
          <summary>Why are reward amounts not listed as final?</summary>
          <div class="faq-card__body">
            <p>Community sources conflict on some reward details. This page keeps reward value claims disputed until a current in-game check confirms them.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>

      <RelatedGuides currentSlug="sewer-maze-map" />
    </article>
  </main>

  <script is:inline>
    const routeTabs = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll("[data-route-tab]"));
    const routePanels = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll("[data-route-panel]"));

    routeTabs.forEach((tab) => {
      tab.addEventListener("click", () => {
        const target = tab.dataset.routeTab;
        routeTabs.forEach((item) => {
          const isActive = item.dataset.routeTab === target;
          item.classList.toggle("is-active", isActive);
          item.setAttribute("aria-selected", String(isActive));
        });
        routePanels.forEach((panel) => {
          panel.classList.toggle("is-active", panel.dataset.routePanel === target);
        });
      });
    });
  </script>
</SiteLayout>
